# A commander with no colors in its identity gives Command Tower no color to add; the ability still pays {T}
# and produces nothing, not even {C} (CR 106.5, 903.4f; official ruling).

[Format]
Commander
[Bot1 Commander]
Ulamog, the Defiler
[Bot1 Deck]
Command Tower
Plains x39
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x40
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Command Tower.Play
? Bot1.CommanderColorIdentity =
! Bot1.Battlefield.Command Tower.Activate(Color: Green)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Command Tower.Activate(Color: C)
Bot1.Battlefield.Command Tower.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Command Tower.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Command = Ulamog, the Defiler
